# Keep the branding out of the Composer dist archive.
#
# installer-banner.png is a full-width hero image referenced only by
# README.md. export-ignore removes it from `git archive`, which is what GitHub
# uses to build the zip Composer downloads for a dist install - so without
# this every `composer global require vigenphp/installer` would pull the image
# down as well. It stays in the repository, so the README still shows it on
# GitHub.
/installer-banner.png export-ignore
